[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6661.35, "timestamp": "01:51:01", "text": "また、ファンを回して"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6665.109, "timestamp": "01:51:05", "text": "ファン速度は100%ですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6667.43, "timestamp": "01:51:07", "text": "自分で扇風機を回して回転させてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6670.55, "timestamp": "01:51:10", "text": "ああ、GPUは本当に厄介だ。だから、私は思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6674.95, "timestamp": "01:51:14", "text": "今は軽いゲームで我慢します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6676.709, "timestamp": "01:51:16", "text": "軽いゲームといえば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6685.189, "timestamp": "01:51:25", "text": "ええ、そうですね。ホロウナイトジャンプキングは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6689.669, "timestamp": "01:51:29", "text": "それを乗り越える。他に何か？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6691.51, "timestamp": "01:51:31", "text": "そういえば、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6695.669, "timestamp": "01:51:35", "text": "このCPU負荷の高いゲームはこれまでずっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6699.03, "timestamp": "01:51:39", "text": "エイペックス・ランドのように。ちなみに、軽いです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6701.03, "timestamp": "01:51:41", "text": "しかし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6703.589, "timestamp": "01:51:43", "text": "多くが欠けている。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6718.79, "timestamp": "01:51:58", "text": "ライターもすごく"}]